WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.199
What is a control?

00:00:03.199 --> 00:00:05.740
Brittany?

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.280
Yes.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.140
Brittany said that a control is something
that stays the same.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.140
Right?

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.940
So you’re changing only one thing in your
experiment and that is the — ?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:21.620
The covering.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:26.780
We’re only changing the covering therefore
everything else in our experiment has to stay

00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:28.119
the same.

00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:32.230
So you are going to figure out with your team
what is that list of things that has to say

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:33.670
the same. Go.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.199
Yeah, actually, so that’s nine.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:47.260
The person who pushes the car, that’s nine.

00:00:47.269 --> 00:00:50.949
But then there’s the eighth one that you’re
missing.

00:00:50.949 --> 00:00:52.370
The ramp.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:55.769
She has ramp, you have position of ramp, that’s
two different things.

00:00:55.769 --> 00:00:58.929
It’s ramp and position of ramp.

00:00:58.929 --> 00:01:01.870
It’s two different things.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.899
So that’s nine actually.

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:07.479
So the ramp and the position of the ramp are
two separate things.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.360
Why?

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:10.649
Why is that two different things?

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:19.460
The ramp is by itself and the position of
the ramp — Is where you put it.

00:01:19.469 --> 00:01:22.489
The position of the ramp is where you put
it on the books.

